* Option file 8 for CPLEX solver - barrier WITHOUT crossover plus aggressive scaling.
* To use with CPLEX, set '$Setglobal USEOPTIONFILE 8' in balgams.opt, or pass --USEOPTIONFILE=8 on the gams command line.
*
* Same as op7, plus "scaind 1" (aggressive scaling). GREAT's rolling LPs have a matrix coefficient
* range of ~[5e-11, 1e7] and about half their solves end "optimal with unscaled infeasibilities"
* (status 5); aggressive scaling is the solver-side mitigation. It does not replace cleaning the
* tiny coefficients / large penalties in the model itself.
* Used by all fullyear and rolling runs; investment runs keep op2. See GREAT's
* docs/adr/0035-fullyear-and-rolling-use-cplex-op8.md.
*
* "LPmethod  4": Barrier method
* "solutiontype  2": No crossover (return non-basic barrier solution)
* "scaind  1": Aggressive scaling
* Threads are set by the job script via the GAMS 'threads=' command line option.

LPmethod  4
solutiontype 2
scaind 1
advind 0
predual -1
